# insta committed snapshots (`*.snap`) are the test fixtures themselves
# and MUST be checked in -- CI runs in non-interactive mode, so a missing
# snapshot fails the assertion. Only `*.snap.new` is local-only: it's the
# pending-review artifact that `cargo insta review` either accepts (rename
# to `.snap`) or discards.
*.snap.new
.claude/agent-memory/
